        "original_id": "90057f53-1d66-5a2f-b3ef-0a049a888392",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kid Rock, Sheryl Crow, Allison Moorer\n- Products: Cocky, \"Picture\", \"Lonely Road of Faith\"\n- Companies: Atlantic, Crow's label\n- Topics: singles, radio re-recordings, duet recordings\n\nFacts:\n- Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\" included the ballad \"Picture\" as a duet recorded with Sheryl Crow.\n- Atlantic was initially unable to get the rights from Sheryl Crow's label to release the album version of \"Picture\" as a single.\n- Kid Rock re-recorded \"Picture\" for radio with Allison Moorer as an alternative version.\n- \"Lonely Road of Faith\" was the second single released from Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
